---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Dive Into Nature: Khao Sok 2-Day Tour"
  description="Experience the beauty of Khao Sok national park on a 2-day tour. Stay in the Khao Sok floating houses. Immerse yourself in nature."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/floating-bunglaows-kha-sok-lake.jpg"
  heroTitle="Dive Into Nature: Khao Sok 2-Day Tour"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok 2 Day Tour", "href": "/khao-sok-2-day-tour/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park and the <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">floating houses</a> are must-see spots for every traveler visiting Thailand. The unique imagination of unreal sunrise and sunset colors is one of the true highlights of Southern Thailand. A great way to enjoy the bungalows is on a <strong>Khao Sok 2-day tour</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This is a personal guide to our overnight stay on the lake. Volunteers Toti and Ale took this tour while staying at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages. They enjoyed a nice retreat away from the land.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We delve into everything you need to know about our Khao Sok 2-day tour. Enjoy two amazing days and one fabulous night in Khao Sok<a href="/category/khao-sok-national-park-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"> National Park</a>. Stay right on the lake, surrounded by nature.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          So many <a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">things to do</a> in Khao Sok make <a href="/khao-sok-travel-guide-how-many-days-to-stay-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">2 days </a>utterly insufficient. Later in this article we investigate other options for spending time away from the lake.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to book your Khao Sok 2-day tour</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Most people start the overnight lake tour from a resort near Khao Sok village. If you stay around the village, book the tour with your hotel – it makes pick up and drop off simple, and it supports the locals.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you skip Khao Sok village, you can start the tour from the town of Ban Ta Khun. From farther away, you will need to take a private taxi. For more info, contact us or have a look at the <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Lake Tours page</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Regardless of where you start, you should <strong>book in advance. Tour operators often fully book the tours several weeks ahead of time.</strong>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How much does the overnight lake tour of Khao Sok National Park cost?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The tour costs between 2,800 and 4,400 Baht depending on where you book. It includes all you need to enjoy a proper retreat. Booking through Riverside Cottages, the price is 3,100 Baht. This includes transport from the resort to the pier in an air-conditioned van.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You will also have a long tail boat transfer to your floating <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">bungalow</a> in Khao Sok National Park. An attentive guide will assist you throughout the entire tour.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The tour includes a variety of activities depending on the season. Some of the best activities we did were:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Exploring caves</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Trekking</a> in the jungle</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Kayaking on the lake</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Spotting wildlife at sunrise</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many more fun things to do existed. The cost of this tour includes all meals, breakfast when you arrive, lunch, dinner, and fruit snacks.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We recommend starting your tour with a night at Riverside Cottages – check out the <a href="/khao-sok-lake-package-river-raft/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Riverside and Raft-house package</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You will usually join with a group tour. If you are concerned about group sizes you might consider a private tour.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Depending on the time of year, they offer private lake tours at the park. These are tailor-made for special occasions. Reach out before arriving in Khao Sok to check for availability.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/floating-bunglaows-kha-sok-lake.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Floating bungalows on Lake Cheow Lan"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Floating bungalows on Lake Cheow Lan</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What to expect in your two days in Khao Sok National Park</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As you walk through the green trees and clear waters of the park, be ready to see the beautiful <a href="/what-is-karst-topography/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">limestone cliffs</a>. Rising from the emerald lakes they support a diverse wildlife that call this place home.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We had a blast seeing such beauty from the longtail boat. The scenery is incredible and might resemble what you have experienced in Koh Phi Phi.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Your Home Away from Home: The Bungalows</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Waking up was a pleasure. We knew something incredible was awaiting us, but the reality exceeded our expectations. Imagine waking up to the gentle rocking of your bungalow, surrounded by the tranquil sounds of nature.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Everything we could have wanted and more was present. Surely two days will make you hope to be back soon. Make the most of your private patio, with stairs direct into the fresh emerald water.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          These special places to stay give you a unique experience. They mix comfort with the natural beauty of the national park.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/khao-sok-lake-trip.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok 2-day tour"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok 2-day tour</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Two days of activities: Exploring Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          From jungle trekking to canoeing along the <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan</a> Lake, each moment in Khao Sok is filled with adventure and discovery. Dive into the heart of the <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-thailand-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">rainforest</a>, accompanied by the symphony of chirping birds and rustling leaves.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Hike up the sticky waterfalls to explore the jungle and the <a href="/rare-endangered-species-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">rare endemic species</a> that live here.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Dining Delights: Savouring Local Flavors</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          What will you love the most, staying on a floating resort overnight? Maybe it is the fine Thai food. As with your stay at Riverside Cottages, you are embracing a gastronomic journey into traditional and authentic Thai Cuisine.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          When we stayed here, we had a mission to try everything on the menu. Thai cuisine is bursting with flavors that reflect the rich tapestry of the local ingredients. From spicy curries to fresh seafood, every meal is a culinary delight.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Enjoy the peace of the magic hour. A sunset like no other!</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          I was on the boat at sunset and had the chance to witness the pinky-orange mountain peaks glowing at their best. On the other side, Ale decided to relax on the patio by the water. He read and disconnected while having little to no internet. Being completely away for the first time in quite a while felt unreal.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As the sun sets, it casts a golden light over the tall cliffs and shining water. Enjoy this moment of peace. <strong>Let the beauty of Khao Sok take your breath away.</strong>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Sustainable Travel: Preserving Khao Sok's Natural Beauty</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As mindful travelers, we understand how important it is to keep the park's beauty for future generations.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sustainable_tourism" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Sustainable travel</a> practices are at the core of our journey. We want to minimize our footprint and respect this natural paradise. We support the locals, try to reduce waste, and always tread lightly on the land. Contribute to the conservation efforts that safeguard Khao Sok’s unique <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-thailand-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">flora and fauna</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Every step we take and every choice we make shows our commitment to keeping this diverse ecosystem healthy.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/khao-sok-riverside-cottages-2.jpg"
            alt="Riverside Cottages - jungle paths"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Riverside Cottages - jungle paths</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Extend your stay – Things to do before or after your Khao Sok 2-Day Tour</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Extend your adventure by unwinding at the charming Khao Sok Riverside Cottages. They nestle along the tranquil banks of the Sok River. Immerse yourself in the sounds of flowing waters and the whispers of the forest as you relax in this idyllic setting.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Savor moments of peace and serenity. The soothing ambiance of the river blends in perfect harmony with the natural surroundings. Relax and let the soft sound of the water help you feel calm.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/khao-sok-riverside-cottages.jpg"
            alt="Riverside Cottages bungalows"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Riverside Cottages bungalows</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Exploration Beyond Borders: Discovering Hidden Gems</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Explore the hidden gems of Khao Sok beyond the Cottages. Discover nearby waterfalls and interesting <a href="/khao-sok-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">caves</a> waiting for you. Just walking around the resort you can find a <a href="/khao-sok-riverside-resort-facilities/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">private beach</a> with chairs to enjoy the river passing by. A few meters away you can soak in the freshwater when it’s too hot.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/riverside-loungers.jpg"
            alt="Riverside loungers"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Riverside loungers</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The friendly staff at reception are always ready to help you find the most suitable activities. Explore beyond the resort, from hiking to canoeing. Experience an Elephant Safari, a night trek in the jungle, or a bike ride around the area. Embark on guided tours or set off on your own adventure to uncover the secrets of this enchanting paradise.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Mahout-washing-his-elephant.jpg"
            alt="Mahout washing his elephant in Khao Sok, Thailand"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Mahout washing his elephant in Khao Sok, Thailand</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Dining with a View: Culinary Delights by the River</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As said before, dining at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages was fantastic. You enjoy a peaceful setting away from traffic, tourists, and the distracting atmosphere. However, you are close enough to reach it when you need to. Every night, we dine al fresco with the tranquil waters of the Sok River as our backdrop.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The restaurant combines Thai and international flavors. You can enjoy the tasty dishes from the region. Pad Thai, Massaman Curry, and Coconut Soup were among our favorites.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Sustainable Practices: Eco-Friendly Escapes</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          At Riverside Cottages, sustainability is at the heart of their ethos. They are all about being eco-friendly and supporting the local communities.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Their goal is to create a positive impact on the environment at their resort. They also want to offer guests a comfortable and responsible stay. Ask the staff about the <a href="/khao-sok-resort/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">initiatives </a>in which they participate.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Connecting with Nature: Activities at Your Doorstep</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Engage in a variety of nature-based activities right at your doorstep. Enjoy birdwatching or <a href="/khao-sok-safari-lake-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">cycling</a> through the verdant trails surrounding the resort. Embrace the great outdoors and forge a deeper connection with the natural wonders of Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Memorable Moments: Creating Everlasting Memories</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We remember every moment, every face, and every person who works hard to make guests' stays special. As the sun sets over the Sok River, it casts a golden glow on the land.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Enjoy the beauty of this moment and the memories you made during your stay. You will create lasting memories on a two-day adventure at this hidden gem of Thailand. Cherish these amazing experiences that will stay with you long after you leave.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Nightfall Adventures: Glimpse into the Nocturnal World</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The night was wonderful, too. Enjoy the low light, no sounds, and light breeze that gently crashes on your floating bungalow. If you are an active person, we highly suggest requesting a <a href="/khao-sok-night-safari/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">night safari</a>. As the Some of the most interesting creatures in the jungle wake up as teh sun starts setting.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          During our adventure, we saw many kinds of insects, new lizard species, various birds, and different types of spiders. We even heard <a href="/asian-elephant-khao-sok-national-park-elephant/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">wild elephants</a> in the distance. Each night safari is different. So many animals to see include Atlas Moths, Mouse Deer, Pangolins, and much more!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/kha-sok-night-safari.jpg"
            alt="Khap Sok night safari"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khap Sok night safari</figcaption>
        </figure>
